Gameplay

 Added 5 new treasures;
 Added new summon: Black Hole;
 Introduced an exclusive infinite mode monster (spawns only in Infinite Challenge);
 Reworked treasure "Diamond Pickaxe": "1. Damage to Brick 100%, 2. For every 2% of your Damage to Brick, Damage to Monster +1%";
 Freeze effect rebalance: Now also slows enemy movement skills;
 AI upgrades: Normal monsters now exhibit more aggressive attack patterns;

Art

 Completely revamped freeze VFX for monsters;

Audio

 New thrust sound effects for the "Spear" summon;

Program

 Performance boost: Optimized multiple VFX
 Dynamic UI scaling: Item effect text now auto-adjusts to fit container size;Gameplay

Gameplay

 Change the key binding and mouse sensitivity during battles are supported;
 Slightly increased the health growth of normal and elite monsters;
 Slightly increased the explosion radius for players to cause explosions;
 Add a treasure "jam" to the initial hero;

Art

 Added sky sphere and volume cloud effects;
 Remade the models of grassland and vegetation;
 Remade the terrain model;
 Optimized level lighting;
 Redraw some widgets in the main menu;

Other

 Fixed some text errors in English localization;
 Fixed an error that occurred when players opened the weapon chests when they were full of weapons;

